## What We Are Building

Driving episode **SS-S15-E12** to completion through the AI pipeline (Designer→Critic→Artist per shot, then animatic/video/stitch). The session was mostly **diagnosis + root-cause fixes**, not feature work: why characters/props render non-canonical, why shot numbering keeps breaking, why Polina stalls, and making the UI reflect pipeline state fast enough to trust.

Key entities: episode_id `725efe84-be85-4a1d-9dfb-1d8aa4afe509`. Active board = `STB-storyboard-v01` (26 shots). Canon: Метёлка `0ce71831` (болонка, LOCKED), smartphone `cc0f8742` (blue #6EC6E8, LOCKED). Cast = `episode_cast v02 APPROVED` (now includes metelka).

