## What WORKED (with evidence)

- **Writer auto-start guard** (`3e2ded4`, master) — cast-approve no longer re-fires Writer when a script exists; warns to feed. Confirmed: tsc 0, vitest 997/997, replay-pilot 30/30.
- **EREF duplicate per-shot agent_started fix** (`3b989d6`, master) — single-shot plan runs no longer double-log "started". Confirmed: tsc 0, vitest 77/77 (eref+next-events).
- **AnimaticPlayer kebab-popover edge-aware anchor** (`a63bc45`, master — committed by Director/neighbor) — popover no longer clipped on SH01/last cell.
- **SH10 Метёлка → canonical болонка** — confirmed by DB: new SH10 ref `source_bible_refs = sandy + metelka(0ce71831) + style`, image APPROVED 09:55. Root was cast scoping (see decisions).
- **Cascade fully cleaned** — storyboard v02 + script v06/QA + reviews + SC10 ref_plans + orphan IMG all INVALIDATED; active board back to v01; 0 live jobs. Verified by repeated DB scans. Legit v01 assets (incl SC10-SH16) spared (verified by created_at < cascade window).
- **Inngest worker bounce** — killed PID 191676, fresh worker on 8288 (HTTP 200). DB job-kill alone does NOT stop in-flight Inngest (proved: orphan IMG written 09:13 after kill); worker restart cleared the in-memory queue.
- **smartphone props_in_frame patch** — 12 non-approved phone shots (SH04,12,13,14,16,20-26) now declare `object_smartphone`. Verified by re-read; approved shots + SH02 (no phone) + SH10 untouched.
- **Polina auto-react cap raised 40→200** in `.env.local` — she resumed tool-calling (inngest log shows tool_call/tool_result at 15:00).
- **UI refresh lag fix** (uncommitted, master working tree) — episode page pipeline+feed SWR 30s→8s; timeline `6s/30s`→`4s/8s`. tsc 0.

