## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **Editing the ref_plan to fix Метёлка** — useless: resolver reads `characters_v2[].bible_slug` from the STORYBOARD ∩ cast, NOT the plan prose. Plan = prompt+provider+size only.
- **"normalize shot_id at the trigger door"** (my proposal) — Director rejected as band-aid #22 (additive armor over rotten foundation). Real fix is the identity refactor (see decisions).
- **Polina re-run of SH13** — STILL came back `SC06` (should be SC07). V08 only checks meta==JSON (internal consistency), NOT vs board → consistently-wrong SC06 PASSED the critic. SH13 will fail at execute (`SC06-SH13 not found in storyboard`).
- **My autonomous SH12 billing-test fire** — blocked by auto-mode classifier (correct): money-gen without explicit Director "go". After "go" it fired HTTP 200 BUT will fail on OpenAI billing.
- **Director raising the "$150" limit** — that's the INTERNAL episode budget, NOT OpenAI. Image-gen still blocked by **OpenAI account hard limit** (`billing_hard_limit_reached`) — untouched.

