## Environment & Setup Notes

- Dev server runs from **main repo** `C:/SandyStudio/webapp` (NOT the worktree) — edits must land there to be live. launch.json points there.
- DB access (read-only or service): `cd /c/SandyStudio/webapp && node --env-file=.env.local -e '...'` with `createClient(process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL, process.env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY)`. NOTE: `.maybeSingle().catch()` is NOT a function (throws) — avoid.
- Nudge Polina: POST `http://localhost:3000/api/team-chat/post` Bearer `EXEC_DIR_AI_TOKEN` (authorized_principal), `{author:"Тео", content, tag}`.
- Inngest worker: port 8288 (`npm run inngest:dev`); Next dev: 3000. DB job-status edits do NOT stop in-flight Inngest — bounce the worker for a hard stop.
